  "title": "High-Protein Peanut Butter Banana Overnight Oats - 25g Protein",
  "description": "Start your morning with high-protein peanut butter banana overnight oats packed with Greek yogurt and whey protein, ready in 10 minutes. This easy make-ahead breakfast fuels your day without any morning cooking. Save it for your next meal prep.",
